        \text{Hardsigmoid}(x) = \begin{cases}
            0 & \text{if~} x \le -3, \\
            1 & \text{if~} x \ge +3, \\
            x / 6 + 1 / 2 & \text{otherwise}
        \end{cases}

    Args:
